  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oYT7eR7.png\" width=\"835\" height=\"273\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Documentation&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=read-the-docs&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"172\" height=\"28\"> &nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/MeherBenSalem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><em><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\"></span></span></span></em></span></strong></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YzIFJTP6r1w\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Улучшение для Minecraft, добавляющее в игру динамические мешки с лутом. За каждого побеждённого моба у вас есть шанс получить мешок с ценными наградами. От обычных ресурсов до эпических сокровищ, эти мешки с лутом разделены на уровни, включая</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Обычные,&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">необычные</span>, <span style=\"color:#3598db\">редкие</span>, <span style=\"color:#843fa1\">эпические</span>,</strong> и<strong> <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">легендарные и многое другое!!</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fnightbeamstudio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5c14e387dab576fe667689cf/670f5a0171bfb928b21a7e00_support_me_on_kofi_beige.png\" alt=\"Brand Assets\" width=\"318\" height=\"64\"></a></p>\n<div>\n<h2>Поддержка &amp; Ссылки</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Discord:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/TJc3CxR4jK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/TJc3CxR4jK</a></li>\n<li>GitHub: <a href=\"https://github.com/MeherBenSalem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/MeherBenSalem</a></li>\n<li>CurseForge: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nightbeamstudio/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/members/nightbeamstudio/projects</a></li>\n<li>Modrinth: <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fnightbeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/organization/nightbeam</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fnightbeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/db9c3eef-25e8-4ac0-93b6-bf386644dcef.webp\"></a></p>",
